@startuml CryptoWeb-state-03-wallet
title CryptoWeb - Simulated Wallet Lifecycle

!theme plain
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam nodesep 65
skinparam ranksep 65
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam StateFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
hide empty description

state "LOCKED" as Locked
state "ACTIVE" as Active

[*] --> Locked : wallet created at registration
Locked --> Active : identity verification approved
Locked --> Locked : identity verification rejected
Active --> Active : approved wallet transaction or trade

note left of Locked
  The wallet is created with zero
  balance and is not eligible for
  trading or wallet operations until
  identity verification is approved.
end note

note left of Active
  Deposits, withdrawals, and trades
  change the balance but not the
  wallet status. There is no separate
  CLOSED state in the stored schema.
end note

@enduml
